{
  "name": "07 Real Estate Lead Matcher - Free-Text Request to Top 3 Listings",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Two entry points: POST /buyer-request (body: {text, contact}) or a new row in the Requests tab (columns: request, contact). An LLM extracts deal, rooms, budget, currency, district, move_in, pets from RU/HY/EN text. Listings tab columns: id, deal, rooms, price, currency, district, address, owner_type (owner|agency), pets_allowed, url. Matches need the same deal, rooms and district and a price within 10% of the budget; owners rank before agencies. The agent gets a Telegram card with the top 3 and the result is logged to Matches. Set sheet IDs, credentials and chat ID.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 230
      },
      "id": "73ba7ffd-2096-53dd-8933-f77b16f75fe4",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "buyer-request",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
